#: docs/app/content/guide/deployment.mdx
msgid ""
"Each page is a directory with an <0/>. Ardo emits internal page links with a "
"trailing slash, such as <1/>, so static hosts serve them without a redirect. "
"With <2><3/></2>, links end without the slash, and the host must serve each "
"page at that address."
msgstr ""
"Chaque page est un répertoire contenant <0/>. Les liens internes se terminent"
" par une barre oblique, comme <1/>, pour éviter les redirections de "
"l’hébergeur. Avec <2><3/></2>, les liens se terminent sans barre oblique, "
"et l’hébergeur doit servir chaque page à cette adresse."

#: docs/app/content/guide/layout-and-navigation.mdx
msgid ""
"Each top-level folder in <0/> becomes a section with its own tab, such as <1/>"
" and <2/>. Folder names Ardo knows, such as <3/>, <4/>, <5/>, <6/>, or <7/>, "
"get a matching label and icon; any other folder gets a text tab named after "
"it. The tab opens the folder's index page, or its first page."
