#: docs/app/content/guide/layout-and-navigation.mdx
msgid ""
"For a standalone outline, use <0/>. The optional <1/> is a CSS selector for "
"the content container. Without it, Ardo reads <2/> inside <3/>, or <4/> itself"
" for a fully custom page. Both modes use <5/> for heading levels. Navigation, "
"the outline itself, hidden headings, and subtrees marked <6/> are excluded. "
"Use that attribute on worked examples whose headings should not become article"
" sections."
msgstr ""
