"Import this file in <0/>. Ardo loads its own stylesheet after it, so the layer"
" order declared here applies: Ardo ships its styles in the <1/> cascade layer,"
" and naming it before <2/> and <3/> lets your utility classes win over Ardo's "
"content styles."
msgstr ""
"Importez le fichier dans <0/>. Ardo charge son stylesheet ensuite ; l’ordre "
"déclaré ici s’applique. Placez <1/> avant <2/> et <3/> pour donner "
"priorité aux utilitaires."

#: docs/app/content/guide/layout-and-navigation.mdx
