"appear only on documentation pages. <0/> redirects to the first documentation "
"entry, preferring configured directory order, shallower entries, frontmatter "
"order, and then route path. The site root does not redirect to a documentation"
" version; <1/> is rejected. With localization, site pages use <2/>, "
"documentation uses <3/>, and the site root redirects to the default site "
"locale."
msgstr ""
