#: docs/app/content/guide/configuration.mdx
msgid ""
"Publishes <0/> and <1/>, two files with the same content, so agents can find "
"the site's resources. Each file lists the <2/> index, the homepage's Markdown "
"version when the homepage is a Markdown page, and the Agent Skills index when "
"skills are published. Every HTML page also links <3/> with <4/>."
