msgstr "Sommaire courant ou liste vide."

#: docs/app/content/guide/publications.mdx
msgid ""
"The default <0/> MDX component renders prepared image metadata, for example "
"<1/>. JSX components also need a portable representation in <2/>. Literal "
"lowercase <3/> elements use normal JSX behavior; use Markdown images or <4/> "
