#: docs/app/content/guide/components.mdx
msgid ""
"The default size is 24 px. Set <0/> to a number or CSS length, or pass native "
"<1/> and <2/> attributes. Icons inherit the surrounding text color. They are "
"decorative by default; supply <3/> or <4/> when the icon conveys information "
"without accompanying text."
msgstr ""
